OL,3,GNEWSAFootball police's alcohol tragedy
OL,4,Alink 'sickening', MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has criticised a football
OL,7,Fpolicing organisation over comments, he
OL,8,Fsaid, linked the Hillsborough disaster
OL,9,Fto the debate over alcohol restrictions
OL,10,Fat matches.
OL,12,FLiverpool West Derby MP Ian Byrne
OL,13,Fdescribed a statement from the UK
OL,14,FFootball Policing Unit (UKFPU) as
OL,15,F"appalling", after it referenced the
OL,16,FTaylor Report and football-related
OL,17,Ftragedies while discussing whether fans
OL,18,Fshould be allowed to drink alcohol in
OL,19,Fview of the pitch.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
