OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFootball police's alcohol tragedy
OL,4,Alink 'sickening', MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UKFPU had been responding to Prime
OL,7,FMinister Andy Burnham's suggestion that
OL,8,Fthe ban on drinking alcohol in football
OL,9,Fstands could be reviewed.
OL,11,FThe policing body has since issued a
OL,12,Ffurther statement saying it had not
OL,13,Fintended to link alcohol with
OL,14,FHillsborough.
